Code shipped inside foliate-js (its vendor/ directory)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
These files are part of the submodule at the commit above. fflate.js and zip.js are minified
bundles without a header, and foliate-js ships no licence file next to them: their licence texts
are therefore reproduced in full below, from the npm packages whose versions foliate-js's
package-lock records (fflate 0.8.2, @zip.js/zip.js 2.8.22; texts read from those packages on
2026-11-18). The bundles themselves are not rebuilt here. The reader loads fflate and zip.js only
(pdf.js is not registered in M5, ADR-0055 D7, and is excluded from the image build context).

